  sourceJson: '{"id":"c4-note","room":"c4","p":[-2.5,1.1,4],"type":"note","label":"A settled arrangement","radius":0.65,"title":"A settled arrangement","text":"Winter keeps the weight; summer holds its plinth.\n\nUse the brass stand to release the current arrangement. While the arch stays in view it cannot move. Turn your whole view away for a moment, then look back."}'
